hey race fans it's time to start those  engines with forza horizon 5 out in the  wild reaching 10 million gamers and  becoming xbox's biggest launch to date  we figured it was the perfect time to  look back at all of the games in the  series motorsport and horizon to see  just how far it's come so buckle up as  we take a ride down memory lane and rank  all 14 games for more on forza make sure  you're subscribed to gamespot  forza street is a free-to-play spin-off  specifically developed for mobile yes  forza has a mobile game and if you  didn't know now you know it features a  very distinct and unique setup from the  main series with players being  responsible for breaking and  accelerating only the game takes control  of the steering forza street is also  available on pc but it doesn't exactly  compare to the rest of the series when  it comes to presentation gameplay  features and support  this standalone racing game features  about a dozen cars from the fast and  furious franchise including some that  debuted in furious 7 which was the  latest entry at the time the game also  featured familiar characters like ted  parker with ludicrous joining and  voicing the expert mechanic as for the  gameplay it involved taking part in  over-the-top racing challenges set in  france just like the movie i'd even  argue that this is better than the full  fast and furious games  i was addicted to motorsport 2. it was  the first sim racer to grab my attention  and keep it for hours and hours on end  if i wasn't playing halo 3 or modern  warfare you best believe i was most  likely playing this featuring more than  300 cars from 50 manufacturers and a  dozen tracks forza motorsport 2 offers  many different ways to play to suit your  style and its assists were a welcome  addition for players just learning the  ropes like me the game was praised for  its innovations at the time like menus  that told you where your car was damaged  and the temperature of your tires to  simulate the real driving experience  released back in 2009 forza motorsport 3  was celebrated for being a step up from  his predecessor in almost every way  among its many different features was a  rewind button that allowed players to  skip back in time after they crash or  make a wrong move the racing game was  also praised for its online modes which  delivered new ways to play both with  friends in a private match and against  the community at large there were new  drag and drift events along with  team-based cat and mouse tournaments  that afforded new ways to play  2011's forza motorsport 4 is perhaps  best remembered for releasing around the  time that microsoft was pushing its  camera base connect technology the  camera would track player's head so that  they can look around or it could just  control the car microsoft would go on to  discontinue connect but forza motorsport  4 showcased how such a setup could have  worked outside of the connect  integration forza motorsport 4 chains  things up with its world tour mode and  made changes to how players unlock cars  and once again the game was praised for  its ability to cater to new players of  all types of skill  levels the very first forza motorsport  game was released in 2005 the game  introduced xbox fans to the simulation  style racing series that would go on to  spawn numerous sequels and spin-offs the  original game was generally praised by  critics and here at gamespot we scored  it a 9.2 with praise directed towards  the game's ability to mesh advanced sim  elements into a package that was  generally acceptable to newcomers it's a  design philosophy that has carried  forward throughout the years across its  numerous installments the game certainly  looks dated by today's standards but it  proved to be a big success that became  one of microsoft's most celebrated  franchises overall  and just when i was getting sick of need  for speed games the first forza horizon  was released for xbox 360. microsoft  tapped playground games to develop the  game and the big change from the main  forza motorsport series is that horizon  is focused on non-track races and  off-road competition in a big open world  the first horizon is set in colorado and  sees players taking part in various  races and competitions to make their way  through the horizon festival where the  game gets its name it will go on to  spawn multiple sequels and help elevate  and differentiate the forza series  overall  2013's forza motorsport 5 was the first  entry released on the new at the time  xbox one console it was actually a  launch title for the xbox one and  microsoft went all out recruiting top  gear hosts jeremy clarkson james may and  richard heyman for voice roles in the  game's campaign  the game boasted gorgeous graphics for  the time showing off what the xbox one  was capable of the racing game also  pushed the franchise forward with clever  use of the xbox one triggers to provide  haptic feedback about traction and  stability  [Music]  2014's forza horizon 2 was the second  entry in the spin-off series and the  first on xbox one set in picturesque  locations across france and italy forza  horizon 2 took some of the action  off-road with races across fields and  dirt giving players a new type of  driving experience similar in structure  to the first game forza horizon 2 has  players taking part in various events  across the campaign that unlocks more  and more cars and settings as the game  progresses  2015's forza motorsport 6 introduced a  seemingly small but important element to  the series  wet weather not only did the rain make  for some unique artistic flair in the  overall look of the game but wet weather  changed driving conditions and this made  an impact on how the game was played and  what you needed to do in order to  succeed on a track during a downpour  knight races were added to motorsport 6  as well adding another layer to mix  things up  the forza motorsport series continued in  2017 with forza motorsport 7 on xbox one  at the time boasting to be the quote  most comprehensive beautiful and  authentic racing game ever made the game  was indeed a nice visual step up  boasting a 4k 60fps experience the game  added new environmental and weather  effects and the rain in particular  glistened in stunning detail there were  an overwhelming 700 plus cars in the  game and 30 famous real world tracks to  race on similar to past games in the  series forza motorsport 7 was also  praised for its feature set that offered  enough for season fans to enjoy and was  also approachable enough for newcomers  forza horizon 3 iterated and improved  upon the first two releases in a number  of ways released in 2016 and set in the  sprawling and gorgeous environments of  australia forza horizon 3 introduced  stunning sky boxes that were based on  real photographs and video has more than  350 cars and is set on what was the  biggest forza horizon map at the time  the game featured new ways to race and  drive and in traditional forza fashion  there were special showcase events  featuring races against speed boats and  airships  released in 2018 forza horizon 4 was  seemingly a special one for developer  playground games being a home game of  sorts with its setting in great britain  in addition to its stunning environments  and sweeping landscapes forza horizon 4  is known for introducing changing  seasons to the franchise letting fans  experience winter spring summer and fall  complete with gameplay relevant changes  to the environment the game also  featured more of an online focus with  dozens of players on a single server  together after launch the game welcomed  numerous expansion packs including those  themed around hot wheels and james bond  the game also leaned into the battle  royale trend with its eliminator mode  horizon 5 the latest in the series takes  place across a vast mexican landscape  roughly 50 percent larger than the map  of horizon 4. there's jungle desert dirt  asphalt and even a volcano and location  aside the game includes new features  like horizon arcade and event lap adding  a whole new layer of replayability while  still keeping hits like the eliminator  there are even character driven story  beats where for the first time in the  series your character talks back to npcs  these moments shake up the established  horizon formula and help the title stand  out amongst its family of other forza  games and whether you're playing on xbox  one xbox series x or a pc horizon 5 is  still a technical and visual treat  hit the comment section and let us know  which of the forza games is your  favorite like this video if you enjoyed  it and make sure you subscribe to  gamespot for more on forza and  everything else under the video game sun  [Music]  you
 

